1
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,120
You said it's just a deal

2
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:23,000
between us.

3
00:00:25,039 --> 00:00:26,559
A deal of 10 taels of gold.

4
00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:30,879
It's not worth your life.

5
00:00:35,679 --> 00:00:37,560
Today, I, a weak woman,

6
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:39,280
first outwitted a killer,

7
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:41,200
then jumped into the cold pool,

8
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:43,439
and finally performed

9
00:00:45,119 --> 00:00:46,079
mouth-to-mouth.

10
00:00:47,079 --> 00:00:47,560
Your Highness,

11
00:00:48,399 --> 00:00:49,719
in my field,

12
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:52,240
you are a rare subject.

13
00:00:52,640 --> 00:00:53,520
I value you as a treasure.

14
00:00:54,119 --> 00:00:54,799
I'm afraid

15
00:00:55,119 --> 00:00:56,799
you're not crazy enough,

16
00:00:57,159 --> 00:00:58,479
or creative enough.

17
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:00,119
Yue Xuan and Fu Yi,

18
00:01:00,479 --> 00:01:01,799
