being alone all these years.

22
00:01:10,040 --> 00:01:11,079
If I had known it was you,

23
00:01:13,760 --> 00:01:15,719
I would never have made a deal with you

24
00:01:16,719 --> 00:01:18,159
and dragged you into this abyss.

25
00:01:58,760 --> 00:01:59,319
Sister,

26
00:02:00,879 --> 00:02:01,840
just pretend that I

27
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:04,680
have forgotten you.

28
00:03:14,039 --> 00:03:15,159
You don't know

29
00:03:15,879 --> 00:03:18,520
