30
00:03:19,439 --> 00:03:20,719
Ji Buyu came with a group of people,

31
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:24,159
with a fierce momentum.

32
00:03:24,639 --> 00:03:27,039
The situation was quite tense.

33
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:28,639
And then?

34
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:30,120
Then,

35
00:03:30,479 --> 00:03:31,879
I wore the cloak

36
00:03:31,879 --> 00:03:32,479
of the Crown Prince.

37
00:03:32,879 --> 00:03:34,360
You know, the one that dragged on the ground.

38
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:39,400
I just stood on the steps.

39
00:03:41,759 --> 00:03:43,960
The wind blew the cloak, making a whooshing sound.

40
00:03:44,439 --> 00:03:45,840
I looked ahead,

41
00:03:45,879 --> 00:03:46,800
