42
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:47,439
Guess what?

43
00:03:49,199 --> 00:03:50,879
Ji Buyu took two steps back in fright.

44
00:03:51,439 --> 00:03:52,360
Her face

45
00:03:53,159 --> 00:03:54,280
