46
00:03:57,599 --> 00:03:58,400
I can't think about it.

47
00:03:59,159 --> 00:04:01,159
We all have a handsome past.

48
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:02,719
My lady, you're so impressive.

49
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:04,439
My lady, drink this bowl of ice.

50
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:05,960
Or the Prince will scold you again.

51
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:11,680
Lady Feng,

52
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:13,960
I've brought what you asked for.

53
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:15,120
How are you feeling?

54
00:04:15,159 --> 00:04:15,719
Much better.

55
00:04:16,319 --> 00:04:17,279
Thanks to Lady Feng

56
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:19,600
