59
00:04:26,079 --> 00:04:26,439
Here.

60
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:32,360
This is it.

61
00:04:33,399 --> 00:04:34,079
Thank you, Lord Shen.

62
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:37,759
What are you talking about?

63
00:04:43,120 --> 00:04:44,800
This isn't Xiao Yunshang's.

64
00:04:45,319 --> 00:04:45,800
Right.

65
00:04:46,399 --> 00:04:47,560
That woman is too bad,

66
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:50,160
but fortunately, her little secret

67
00:04:50,160 --> 00:04:51,040
is in my hands.

68
00:05:07,399 --> 00:05:08,800
Everything that happened in the past

69
00:05:09,279 --> 00:05:10,360
