70
00:05:10,720 --> 00:05:11,519
Whether it's the sash

71
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:13,120
or the assassination,

72
00:05:13,519 --> 00:05:14,639
it's all because of Xiao Yunshang

73
00:05:14,639 --> 00:05:15,399
