74
00:05:16,519 --> 00:05:17,360
Ji Buyu has it,

75
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:19,000
the guards in the Palace have it,

76
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:20,439
and Xiao Yunshang herself

77
00:05:20,439 --> 00:05:21,439
also carries it with her.

78
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:23,279
I was afraid I got it wrong,

79
00:05:23,439 --> 00:05:24,240
