81
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:28,199
Now the evidence is solid.

82
00:05:28,639 --> 00:05:30,399
None of this is a coincidence.

83
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:31,959
The sachet is a token

84
00:05:32,199 --> 00:05:33,000
and a mark.

85
00:05:33,360 --> 00:05:35,279
The wearer is all Xiao Yunshang's people.

86
00:05:35,800 --> 00:05:38,120
That's why Ye Xuan can hold a weapon

87
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:40,279
and go to the Palace without any obstruction.

88
00:05:42,759 --> 00:05:44,399
But these sachets are of different shapes.

89
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:45,720
They are not uniform.

90
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:48,000
The style can be different,

91
00:05:48,199 --> 00:05:49,279
but there must be similarities.

92
00:05:51,759 --> 00:05:52,160
Look,

93
00:05:53,439 --> 00:05:55,160
the tassel of Xiao Yunshang's sachet

94
00:05:55,399 --> 00:05:56,480
