95
00:05:58,279 --> 00:05:58,879
Based on my years of experience

96
00:05:58,879 --> 00:06:00,000
in painting,

97
00:06:01,439 --> 00:06:03,199
under the current production capacity,

98
00:06:03,279 --> 00:06:04,199
the number of processes

99
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:05,600
