100
00:06:05,879 --> 00:06:06,920
is very clear to me.

101
00:06:07,680 --> 00:06:08,680
I spent a lot of money

102
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:09,720
to get a little.

103
00:06:10,279 --> 00:06:11,160
Coincidentally,

104
00:06:11,759 --> 00:06:13,040
only the Yunshang Palace

105
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:14,560
is willing to buy

106
00:06:14,639 --> 00:06:15,480
such a large quantity.

107
00:06:16,759 --> 00:06:17,759
No wonder

108
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:19,519
I never noticed it.

109
00:06:21,279 --> 00:06:22,600
You must not be able to distinguish

110
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:23,680
the color of the lipstick of a woman.

111
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:29,319
So you

112
00:06:29,319 --> 00:06:30,279
would never notice

113
00:06:30,399 --> 00:06:31,839
