114
00:06:31,959 --> 00:06:32,680
or scarlet.

115
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:33,879
But I can.

116
00:06:34,279 --> 00:06:35,279
I studied painting.

117
00:06:35,519 --> 00:06:36,480
I'm most sensitive to colors.

118
00:06:37,519 --> 00:06:38,240
Xiao Yunshang

119
00:06:38,319 --> 00:06:39,959
dares to do this kind of thing.

120
00:06:40,439 --> 00:06:42,040
First, because she is overconfident.

121
00:06:42,519 --> 00:06:43,560
Second, because

122
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:46,240
