125
00:06:52,040 --> 00:06:52,879
I see.

126
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:55,560
Leave it to me, Gu Jiachen.

127
00:06:56,199 --> 00:06:57,120
In my hometown,

128
00:06:57,480 --> 00:06:58,800
I'm best at

129
00:06:59,240 --> 00:07:01,120
doing the toughest things

130
00:07:01,240 --> 00:07:02,439
in the most laid-back way.

131
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:06,439
It seems you already have a plan.

132
00:07:17,600 --> 00:07:18,560
Be careful your wound opens up.

133
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:20,360
This little wound?

134
00:07:21,079 --> 00:07:22,399
Don't underestimate the vitality

135
00:07:22,439 --> 00:07:23,600
