136
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:24,759
Workers?

137
00:07:25,959 --> 00:07:27,759
Yes, workers.

138
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:30,519
The strongest carbon-based life forms in the universe,

139
00:07:30,839 --> 00:07:32,079
the workers from another dimension.

140
00:07:32,480 --> 00:07:33,279
We can stay up

141
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:34,839
all night long.

142
00:07:35,160 --> 00:07:36,040
We can withstand

143
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:38,199
