144
00:07:39,199 --> 00:07:40,439
As long as the boss pays well,

145
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:41,600
we are

146
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:43,040
the cockroach that never dies.

147
00:07:48,680 --> 00:07:50,560
What are these drawings for?

148
00:08:03,959 --> 00:08:04,959
I asked Shen Li to do it.

149
00:08:09,319 --> 00:08:09,839
Ladies and gentlemen,

150
00:08:10,839 --> 00:08:12,399
