154
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:27,800
Lady Feng,

155
00:08:28,040 --> 00:08:29,000
the palace's blueprints

156
00:08:29,319 --> 00:08:30,439
have been distributed.

157
00:08:31,600 --> 00:08:32,440
The maids and

158
00:08:32,600 --> 00:08:33,879
courtiers are all talking about it.

159
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:37,200
But will it really work?

160
00:08:37,879 --> 00:08:38,679
It's my first time

161
00:08:38,759 --> 00:08:39,840
dealing with Princess Xiao.

162
00:08:40,639 --> 00:08:42,919
I'm really nervous.

163
00:08:43,559 --> 00:08:44,480
Lord Shen,

164
00:08:44,559 --> 00:08:45,879
