165
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:47,039
Can you not be so anxious?

166
00:08:49,120 --> 00:08:50,039
Anxiety is good.

167
00:08:50,799 --> 00:08:52,600
It means my strategy

168
00:08:53,039 --> 00:08:54,639
