178
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:17,240
Are you stupid?

179
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:18,799
Look at the small characters on it.

180
00:09:19,480 --> 00:09:20,840
Red tassel,

181
00:09:21,039 --> 00:09:22,080
worth hundreds of gold.

182
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:24,000
This dye is extremely valuable.

183
00:09:24,080 --> 00:09:25,320
Only the Noble Consort's people

184
00:09:25,399 --> 00:09:26,840
can afford to use this.

185
00:09:27,720 --> 00:09:28,519
So,

186
00:09:28,559 --> 00:09:29,799
just by looking at the color of the tassel,

187
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:30,360
we can tell

188
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:31,399
