189
00:09:31,559 --> 00:09:32,120
Exactly.

190
00:09:32,399 --> 00:09:33,639
We must be cautious in the future.

191
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:35,360
Don't offend the nobles without realizing it.

192
00:09:45,720 --> 00:09:46,320
Lord Liu,

193
00:09:50,399 --> 00:09:51,399
His Majesty is gravely ill.

194
00:09:52,159 --> 00:09:54,720
The last thing he wants is for the harem to form factions

195
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:56,440
and to pry into his whereabouts.

196
00:09:57,960 --> 00:10:00,639
The Noble Consort can't wait anymore.

197
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:01,919
She has

198
00:10:01,919 --> 00:10:03,480
