211
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:28,279
Anyone who wears this sachet

212
00:10:29,039 --> 00:10:30,159
is from the Yunshang Palace.

213
00:10:31,320 --> 00:10:32,200
See and avoid.

214
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:33,120
The grand censors

215
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:35,120
