216
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:39,320
What a beautiful color and style.

217
00:10:40,399 --> 00:10:41,919
This is my only pleasure.

218
00:10:43,039 --> 00:10:44,039
I don't know which one

219
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:46,480
