220
00:10:47,159 --> 00:10:48,720
Go, pass the order down.

221
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:50,799
Let everyone lie low for now.

222
00:10:51,200 --> 00:10:52,679
All sachets are to be recalled.

223
00:10:54,120 --> 00:10:54,519
Yes.

224
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:55,639
Wait.

225
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:01,399
