232
00:11:32,879 --> 00:11:33,279
Nothing.

233
00:11:34,399 --> 00:11:35,799
Just got a bit numb from sitting.

234
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:40,720
Your skills are terrible.

235
00:11:41,399 --> 00:11:43,720
I'll cover your bets today.

236
00:11:45,039 --> 00:11:45,759
Thank you, Your Highness.

237
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:48,679
Su, it's time to go.

238
00:11:50,879 --> 00:11:51,399
Right, right.

239
00:11:51,679 --> 00:11:52,480
Let's go.

240
00:12:01,000 --> 00:12:02,080
Thanks to you,

241
00:12:04,279 --> 00:12:05,600
without any effort,

242
00:12:06,320 --> 00:12:08,000
you've almost ruined Xiao Yunshang's

243
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:10,000
years of planning in a short time.

244
00:12:10,879 --> 00:12:13,080
Don't mention it.

245
00:12:13,639 --> 00:12:14,720
Xiao Yunshang messed with me.

246
00:12:14,759 --> 00:12:16,080
She's bitten off more than she can chew.

247
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:18,279
She should have done some research.

248
00:12:18,720 --> 00:12:20,679
She should know how I survived

249
00:12:20,720 --> 00:12:21,679
