250
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:23,159
Party A?

251
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:27,159
The kind of person

252
00:12:29,480 --> 00:12:30,960
who doesn't share a drink with me,

253
00:12:31,840 --> 00:12:33,120
eats alone,

254
00:12:33,759 --> 00:12:35,480
who doesn't pay on time.

255
00:12:37,200 --> 00:12:37,720
I...

256
00:12:37,720 --> 00:12:38,639
I wasn't talking about you.

257
00:12:40,440 --> 00:12:41,320
After all,

258
00:12:42,159 --> 00:12:43,120
His Highness

259
00:12:43,360 --> 00:12:44,600
is far more generous

260
00:12:44,639 --> 00:12:45,480
than those clients.

261
00:12:46,720 --> 00:12:48,080
He's good-looking,

262
00:12:48,879 --> 00:12:50,320
chaste,

263
00:12:51,080 --> 00:12:52,000
and easily blushes.

264
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:58,159
Just like old times,

265
00:12:58,360 --> 00:12:59,399
he's still easy to tease.

266
00:13:02,480 --> 00:13:03,879
By the way, Gu Jiachen,

267
00:13:04,919 --> 00:13:05,919
once you're done,

268
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:06,919
let's pick a good day

269
00:13:06,919 --> 00:13:07,559
to go out and have fun.

270
00:13:09,440 --> 00:13:09,879
Where to?

271
00:13:10,440 --> 00:13:12,120
[If we spend more time alone with him,]

272
00:13:12,639 --> 00:13:13,360
[maybe]

273
00:13:13,559 --> 00:13:14,720
[he'll remember something.]

274
00:13:16,360 --> 00:13:17,759
To the market,

275
00:13:18,159 --> 00:13:20,320
to enjoy fine food and scenery,

276
00:13:20,840 --> 00:13:21,600
to see the jugglers,

277
00:13:22,240 --> 00:13:23,320
to

278
00:13:25,320 --> 00:13:26,799
visit all the places

279
00:13:27,480 --> 00:13:28,200
we haven't been to.

280
00:13:28,919 --> 00:13:30,679
[The dull head actually has feelings now.]

281
00:13:31,639 --> 00:13:33,120
[He must be peeking at my sketchbook again.]

282
00:13:33,120 --> 00:13:33,720
[Isn't it?]

283
00:13:34,120 --> 00:13:34,559
Okay,

284
00:13:35,759 --> 00:13:36,399
I promise you.

285
00:13:37,679 --> 00:13:38,320
Then it's a deal.

286
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:40,120
This is our first date,

287
00:13:40,240 --> 00:13:41,080
